      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this is in common/ you\u0027ll need to use the generic wrappers we\u0027ve created for Zephyr\u0027s mutexes. See task.h\u0027s:\n  typedef struct k_mutex mutex_t;\n\n\nWe don\u0027t have this yet for k_condvar so you\u0027ll need to create it. Alternatively, you could try to do this in the shim layer and add hooks to it in the header (it would get messy but I\u0027m not sure if it\u0027ll be easier than providing a k_condvar to cros_ec).",
      "revId": "2b56b619f3de4d4d09b9203e3fc8ce7e3821510e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
